      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The treatment of temporomandibular disorders continues to provide dental practitioners with a difficult challenge that has yet to overcome numerous major obstacles. In this, the first of a series of three articles, an overview of the current understanding of the diagnosis of temporomandibular disorders will be presented. The subsequent two articles will present an overview of the management strategies that have appeared in the literature in recent years."},
